        {
            "title": "英偉達宣布恢復黃仁勳行政總裁職務",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國芯片制造商英偉達公司11月23日在官方網站發布公告，宣布恢復黃仁勳總裁、行政總裁及董事會成員職務。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：英偉達官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Nvidia-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：英偉達官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Nvidia-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：英偉達官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">公告表示，英偉達董事會經與黃仁勳多輪溝通會商後，全票通過復職決議；董事會認可黃仁勳的坦誠態度，相信其具備領導英偉達的能力。在作出該決定的過程中，董事會聽取了美國政府高層的意見，並據此認定，黃仁勳復職不會帶來國家安全風險。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：英偉達官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Nvidia-1.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：英偉達官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Nvidia-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：英偉達官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"英偉達公告。\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/20261123_GL_source-web_NVIDIA_01.png.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"英偉達公告。\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/20261123_GL_source-web_NVIDIA_01.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">英偉達公告。</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/941x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/2026116_CR_source_web_huang5.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/941x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/2026116_CR_source_web_huang5.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"黃仁勳 。AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/20240606_FI_source-ap_Nvidia-3.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳 。AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/20240606_FI_source-ap_Nvidia-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">黃仁勳 。AP圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls-text bpcategory-special-color\">更多相片</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__buttons\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：英偉達官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/07/20250715_FI_source-web_Nvidia-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：英偉達官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"英偉達公告。\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/20261123_GL_source-web_NVIDIA_01.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">英偉達公告。</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/941x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/2026116_CR_source_web_huang5.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳 。AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/20240606_FI_source-ap_Nvidia-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">黃仁勳 。AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"英偉達公告。\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/20261123_GL_source-web_NVIDIA_01.png.webp\">\n<img alt=\"英偉達公告。\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/20261123_GL_source-web_NVIDIA_01.png.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">英偉達公告。</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英偉達董事會主席哈維・C・瓊斯表示：「董事會認為，黃仁勳是領導英偉達的合適人選，他的復職符合股東、員工、合作夥伴與客戶的最大利益。我們對黃仁勳抱有十足信心，期待在他重新執掌公司期間攜手共事。我們也感謝科萊特・克雷斯在臨時首席執行官任上的出色工作，她將繼續擔任英偉達首席財務官。」 哈維・瓊斯將繼續留任董事會主席。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/941x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/2026116_CR_source_web_huang5.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/941x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/2026116_CR_source_web_huang5.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">黃仁勳早前向員工發訊息，承認自己對妻子不忠。小紅書圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">黃仁勳稱：「能夠重返英偉達，在新一輪工業革命開啟之際領導這家全球舉足輕重的科技企業，我深感榮幸。我將懷著謙卑之心扛起這份責任，重新許下承諾。感謝董事會在整個過程中的審慎考量與信任；特別感謝哈維・瓊斯作為主席的擔當，感謝科萊特・克雷斯以及高管團隊在這一階段維系公司運轉。同時，由衷感謝全體員工、股東、行業同仁與全球合作夥伴給予的大力支持。最重要的是，感謝家人的關愛與支持。我已經迫不及待回歸工作。」</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"黃仁勳 。AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/20240606_FI_source-ap_Nvidia-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"黃仁勳 。AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/06/20240606_FI_source-ap_Nvidia-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">黃仁勳 。AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17247493-%e8%8b%b1%e5%81%89%e9%81%94%e5%ae%a3%e5%b8%83%e6%81%a2%e5%be%a9%e9%bb%83%e4%bb%81%e5%8b%b3%e8%a1%8c%e6%94%bf%e7%b8%bd%e8%a3%81%e8%81%b7%e5%8b%99",
